Package: FedMEGA
Title: Federated Mixed-Model Genome-Wide Association Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Xiaowen",
           family = "Suo",
           email = "sxw13032232078@163.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Core implementation of FedMEGA, a three-site federated
    mixed-model GWAS framework with FedLMM for continuous phenotypes and
    FedBMM for binary phenotypes. The package provides the algorithmic
    implementation used in the manuscript, including federated null-model
    fitting, null mixed-model fitting, score testing, and GRAMMAR-Gamma
    approximation. Users can specify arbitrary covariate columns available
    in all participating sites.
